 r←Test_StdForm_008(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;n;appName;rk;posn;size;rk2;globalParms;MyGuiParms
⍝ Check Posn and Size in the Registry: "addToCaption" is set but "regKey2" is empty, so nothing is saved
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 CreateGlobalParms
 globalParms←⎕NS MyGuiParms
 appName←globalParms.regKey
 rk←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiUtils.GetRegPath appName
 rk2←rk,'\',globalParms.caption

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions - just in case of any leftovers
 :If ##.WinReg.DoesKeyExist rk
     ##.WinReg.DeleteSubKey rk2
 :EndIf

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←''
 parms.size←200 400
 parms.posn←35 45
 parms.regKey2←''       ⍝ Overwrites default: nothing is saved in the registry
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 posn←100 200
 size←500 220
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Configure',posn,size
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 1 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠+/##.WinReg.DoesValueExist¨(rk2,'\posn')(rk2,'\size')
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
⍝⍝⍝ Clean up
 ##.WinReg.DeleteSubKey rk2
 ##.WinReg.DeleteSubKey rk
